title=\"Special event history\">Festivult (Gold Coin Rewards)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Green_Steel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Green Steel\">Green Steel</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Green_Steel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Green Steel\">Green Steel</a>:</b> <b>Greensteel</b> is a rare and special material that can be crafted in the Vale of Twilight.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Green_Steel_Greatclub.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Green_Steel_Greatclub.png/420px-Green_Steel_Greatclub.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"461\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Green_Steel_Greatclub.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Green_Steel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Green Steel\">Green Steel</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A more formidable version of a simple club, this two-handed weapon is occasionally reinforced with spikes or bands of iron.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Unlike most <a href=\"/page/Greensteel_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greensteel Weapon\">Greensteel Weapons</a>, the Greensteel Greatclub is not craftable<br />\nIt's only available as a possible reward when turning in Gold Coin during <a href=\"/page/Festivult\" title=\"Festivult\">Festivult</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817044807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3556/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22245/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5063/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 10/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   77.532      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   77.532      1 -total\n 96.57%   74.871      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 91.33%   70.807     36 Template:IO\n